usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kanjy00u2/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2d66115/uploads/origins/cf938525-e557-44a2-a53c-17e93e02afbe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93eb1d5a87b8e5ae47ea08404b7c5b50", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d2d66115/uploads/origins/cf938525-e557-44a2-a53c-17e93e02afbe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93eb1d5a87b8e5ae47ea08404b7c5b50, https://si.imgix.net/d2d66115/uploads/origins/cf938525-e557-44a2-a53c-17e93e02afbe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eff9a9793cd95797fd2c5832a465286e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d2d66115/uploads/origins/cf938525-e557-44a2-a53c-17e93e02afbe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0dfb41e9b73f89e2ce654ee40b1bcb96 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "うちの子のパイズリ絵をお願いしてもいいでしょうか？\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DGbI-jL0cnKK2Z2l7j1HRCMuNf3dNw-p?usp=sharing\n\n先生のパイズリ絵は素敵で、できればぜひうちの子のも見たいです…！\n\n具体的な構図や衣装とかお任せします～\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}